  "pageTitle": "8x8",
  "link": "https://westpiertech.com/8x8/",
  "issue": "Add an FAQ block (8 questions)",
  "before": "Why switch to West Pier",
  "current": "(no FAQ on the page)",
  "proposed": "Heading: Common questions about 8x8\n\nQ: What is 8x8?\nA: 8x8 is a cloud phone and contact centre platform. Calls, video meetings, team chat and contact centre all run in one app on desktop, mobile and desk phones, with no phone system kept in your office.\n\nQ: Is 8x8 a good fit for a small business?\nA: Yes. You pay per user, so a small team only pays for the licences it needs and can add people as it grows. Our guide to <a href=\"https://westpiertech.com/8x8-small-business-pay-as-you-go-phone-system-uk-smes/\">8x8 for small businesses</a> explains the options.\n\nQ: Can we keep our existing phone numbers if we move to 8x8?\nA: Yes. We port your existing UK numbers to 8x8 and agree the switchover date with you, so calls keep coming in on the day.\n\nQ: Does 8x8 work with Microsoft Teams?\nA: Yes. 8x8 is a Microsoft Operator Connect partner, so your staff can make and take outside calls inside Teams. If you don't use Teams, the 8x8 app does the same job on its own.\n\nQ: Does 8x8 include a contact centre?\nA: Yes. 8x8 Contact Centre adds queues, call routing, wallboards and reporting on the same platform as your phones. Agents and the rest of the business share one system, so passing a caller to the right person is simple.\n\nQ: What business software does 8x8 connect to?\nA: 8x8 connects to CRM and helpdesk tools such as Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Zendesk, so the caller's record opens when the phone rings. See <a href=\"https://westpiertech.com/what-does-8x8-integrate-with/\">what 8x8 integrates with</a> for more.\n\nQ: Does 8x8 have AI features?\nA: Yes. 8x8 builds AI into the platform for things like call transcription, summaries and smarter routing. Our guide to <a href=\"https://westpiertech.com/8x8-ai-studio-built-in-ai-for-uk-businesses-that-want-to-grow-faster/\">8x8 AI Studio</a> covers what's included.\n\nQ: Why buy 8x8 through West Pier rather than direct?\nA: We plan the move, build your call flows, port your numbers and train your staff. After go-live you deal with a UK support team who know your setup, not a general helpdesk.",
